IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HYSTERIA-MONITOR.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINK-NAME       PIC X(20) VALUE "PROXY-HYSTERIA-LINK".
01 WS-LOSS-RATE       PIC 9(2) VALUE 5.
01 WS-THROUGHPUT      PIC 9(4) VALUE 1000.
01 WS-THRESHOLD       PIC 9(2) VALUE 10.
01 WS-ALERT           PIC X(30).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "--- MONITORING NETWORK RESILIENCE ---".
    DISPLAY "LINK: " WS-LINK-NAME.
    DISPLAY "CURRENT LOSS RATE: " WS-LOSS-RATE "%.".
    
    IF WS-LOSS-RATE > WS-THRESHOLD
        MOVE "ALERT: HIGH LOSS - ADJUST BANDWIDTH" TO WS-ALERT
    ELSE
        MOVE "STATUS: STABLE" TO WS-ALERT
    END-IF.
    
    DISPLAY "STATUS: " WS-ALERT.
    DISPLAY "THROUGHPUT: " WS-THROUGHPUT " KBPS.".
    
    IF WS-LOSS-RATE > 0
        DISPLAY "ACTION REQUIRED: CHECK UDP CONFIGURATION."
    END-IF.
    
    STOP RUN.